	&lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;div class="alert-body"&gt;
		&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We use environment variables to configure the application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We use &lt;a href="https://docs.rs/envconfig/latest/envconfig/" target="_blank" &gt;&lt;code&gt;envconfig&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to initialize configuration &lt;code&gt;struct&lt;/code&gt; from environment variables on application start, and immediately panic if no configuration is set.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Then, pass that &lt;code&gt;struct&lt;/code&gt; to the router via &lt;code&gt;AppState&lt;/code&gt; to use it to configure middleware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
